> Today:  ^   trap_id   identify a previously found trap

This is very helpful on the Plane of Water where you far-locate the portal
and whenever you come close to an object (that might hide the trap so that
you cannot see the portal while nearby) you use that ^ command to be told
whether there's a trap or not at the adjacent square. Otherwise you'd have
to step onto that square, thus get separated from your pets unintentionally.
Also valuable in a crowded area where corpses are lying all around and one
critter escaped by digging down, where the invisible hole still covered by
loot.

